    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLocated within the sought-after Maples development, this impressive four-bedroom detached residence offers spacious and versatile accommodation designed to meet the needs of modern family living. Presented with well-proportioned rooms throughout, the property benefits from a bright sitting room, an open-plan kitchen/dining area, a flexible ground floor office or fourth bedroom, and three generous bedrooms on the first floor.\nThe layout flows effortlessly from room to room, creating a home that is equally suited to everyday family life and entertaining. Outside, the property enjoys a private walled rear garden laid in lawn, providing a safe and secure space for children to play or for outdoor dining and relaxation. Conveniently located close to schools, shops, sporting facilities and Arklow's excellent transport links, this is an ideal home for families seeking space, convenience and a well-established residential setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.71m x 2.06m\nWelcoming entrance hallway providing access to all ground floor accommodation, with staircase leading to the first-floor landing.\n\nLiving Room - 5.53m x 4.09m\nA bright and comfortable reception room located to the front of the property, featuring laminate flooring and an open fireplace. Double doors connect seamlessly to the kitchen/dining area, creating an excellent flow for both everyday living and entertaining.\n\nKitchen - 5.02m x 2.97m\nSpacious open-plan kitchen and dining area overlooking the rear garden. The kitchen is fitted with a range of floor and wall-mounted units and incorporates an integrated oven and hob. A sliding patio door provides direct access to the rear garden and fills the room with natural light.\n\nUtility Room - 2.86m x 1.61m\nConveniently positioned off the kitchen, the utility room offers additional storage and laundry facilities together with side access to the property.\n\nWC - 1.94m x 0.80m\nLocated beneath the staircase and fitted with W.C. and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 4 / Study - 3.34m x 2.86m\nSituated to the front of the property, this versatile room offers a variety of potential uses including a home office, playroom, guest accommodation or fourth bedroom.\n\nLanding - 6.10m x 2.43m\nSpacious landing area with access to all first-floor accommodation\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.31m x 4.11m\nA generous double bedroom positioned to the front of the property, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and spacious en-suite bathroom.\n\nEn-Suite - 4.70m x 3.14m\nTiled floor with part-tiled walls, comprising W.C., double wash hand basin, walk-in shower and bath\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.14m x 2.86m\nDouble bedroom laid in carpet.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.90m x 2.86m\nDouble bedroom laid in carpet.\n\nBathroom - \nFamily bathroom fitted with W.C., wash hand basin, bidet and walk-in shower.\n\nOutside - \nThe property enjoys a fully enclosed walled rear garden laid in lawn, offering a private outdoor space with excellent potential for family enjoyment and outdoor entertaining.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Detached 4-bedroom family home</li><li> Utility room with side access</li><li> Master bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and en-suite</li><li> Enclosed walled rear garden</li><li> Oil-fired central heating</li><li> Mains water, sewage and electricity</li><li> Convenient location close to Arklow town amenities and transport links</ul>"
      },
      {
